member.summary:
The customer's running (or not yet started) day pass, if any: Active and
            not yet past its last day. Data from before the one-pass rule may hold several;
            the biggest pack wins, then the one ending last.

Before any hold exists: may this customer pay later at all, and for which
            booking kinds. Checks the switch, the customer's flag and the open-bookings limit;
            the amount limits are checked per booking at confirmation.
